# Secrets never enter the build context (images must get config from the environment).
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Reinstalled / rebuilt inside the image
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/coverage

# Not needed at runtime
.git
.github
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/test
docs
scripts
HANDOFF.md
PLAN.md
**/AGENTS.md
**/CLAUDE.md
